========================================================================
  STEP 6 — tools/call get_requirement (REQ-003)
========================================================================
An agent would now iterate the spec with validate_spec and refine_requirement,
then turn these acceptance criteria into an executable Gherkin scenario (BDD)
plus failing unit tests (TDD) — the spec (SDD) stays the source of truth.
